WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.240
10:42.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:07.000
Your security team sees unusual privileged
activity from a strategic

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:07.940
partner's account.

4
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.920
Behavior never seen from this account before.

5
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.040
That partner supports critical infrastructure.

6
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.020
10:48.

7
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.880
The vendor says its investigation found no
evidence of compromise and

8
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.400
warns that cutting access will interrupt critical
support.

9
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.340
11:13.

10
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:31.420
Threat intelligence reports another company
investigating suspicious activity

11
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.080
involving the same vendor.

12
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.100
Neither organization has confirmed a compromise.

13
00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.900
No malware detected. no confirmed lateral
movement. no known

14
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.300
malicious IP traffic.

15
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.000
Three reports.

16
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.080
An uncomfortable amount still unknown.

17
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.560
What should you do?
